{"speciesId":333,"names":{"fr":"Tylton","es":"Swablu","en":"Swablu","ja":"チルット"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SWABLU has light and fluffy wings that are like cottony clouds. This POKéMON is not frightened of people. It lands on the heads of people and sits there like a cotton-fluff hat."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SWABLU loves to make things clean. If it spots something dirty, it will wipe and polish it with its cottony wings. If its wings become dirty, this POKéMON finds a stream and showers itself."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A POKéMON that has wings like cottony clouds. After enduring winter, in which little food is available, SWABLU flocks move closer to towns in the spring."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its wings are like cotton tufts. If it perches on someone’s head, it looks like a cotton hat."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its wings are like cotton tufts. If it perches on someone’s head, it looks like a cotton hat."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its wings bring cottony clouds to mind. It grooms with springwater and loves to sit on heads."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its wings bring cottony clouds to mind. It grooms with springwater and loves to sit on heads."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il ne se sent à l’aise que dans un milieu propre et repousse la poussière avec ses ailes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il ne se sent à l’aise que dans un milieu propre et repousse la poussière avec ses ailes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"For some reason, it likes to land on people’s heads softly and act like it’s a hat."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"For some reason, it likes to land on people’s heads softly and act like it’s a hat."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son jeu préféré : se poser sur la tête des gens et se faire passer pour un joli chapeau."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se desconoce el porqué, pero le encanta posarse sobre la cabeza de los humanos y fingir que es un gorro."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"For some reason, it likes to land on people’s heads softly and act like it’s a hat."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"人の 頭の 上に ちょこんと 乗って 帽子のように ふるまうのが なぜか 大好き。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il toilette constamment ses ailes duveteuses. Il se dépêche de se laver à la moindre salissure pour que ses ailes restent le plus blanc possible."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Está continuamente acicalándose las alas de algodón que tiene. Si se ensucia, se da una ducha para limpiarse enseguida."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"真綿の ような 翼の 手入れは 絶対に 欠かさない。汚れると 水浴びをして きれいに 洗う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tylton est doté d’ailes légères et duveteuses comme des nuages cotonneux. Ce Pokémon n’est pas très sauvage. Il lui arrive d’atterrir sur la tête des gens et d’y rester, comme un chapeau ouaté."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Swablu tiene unas alas ligeras y esponjosas que parecen nubes de algodón. A este Pokémon no le asusta la gente. De hecho, puede llegar a posarse en la cabeza de alguien y servirle de gorro sedoso."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Swablu has light and fluffy wings that are like cottony clouds. This Pokémon is not frightened of people. It lands on the heads of people and sits there like a cotton-fluff hat."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"綿雲の ような ふさふさの 翼を 持つ。 人を 怖がらず 綿の 帽子 みたいに 頭に ちょこんと 乗っかる ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Tylton adore nettoyer. S’il repère quelque chose de sale, il l’essuie et le polit avec ses ailes cotonneuses. Lorsque ses ailes se salissent, ce Pokémon trouve un cours d’eau et se lave."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A Swablu le encanta limpiarlo todo. Si ve algo sucio, lo dejará como nuevo y reluciente con las alas de algodón que tiene. Cuando se le ensucian, busca un manantial y las limpia."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Swablu loves to make things clean. If it spots something dirty, it will wipe and polish it with its cottony wings. If its wings become dirty, this Pokémon finds a stream and showers itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"汚れたものを 見ると 綿の ような 翼で せっせと ふき取る きれい好きな ポケモンだ。 翼が 汚れると 川で 水浴びを する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses ailes ressemblant à du coton contiennent de l’air, ce qui leur confère une texture duveteuse. Elles nécessitent un entretien minutieux."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Sus alas algodonadas contienen aire, lo que les aporta un tacto suave y esponjoso. Se las acicala continuamente."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its cottony wings are full of air, making them light and fluffy to the touch. Swablu takes diligent care of its wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"真綿のような 翼は 空気を 含んで ふわふわの 触り心地。 こまめな 手入れを 欠かさない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses ailes en forme de nuage le dissimulent aux yeux des ennemis. On raconte qu’elles sont devenues blanches après plusieurs générations."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Sus alas parecen nubes algodonadas y lo ocultan de sus rivales. Se cree que se volvieron blancas con el paso de las generaciones."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Since Swablu looks like a cumulus cloud, foes can have a hard time finding it. Apparently its wings turned white over many generations."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"綿雲に 見えるため 敵から 見つかりにくい。 世代を 重ねるうち 翼が 白くなったという。"}],"varieties":[{"id":333,"moves":[{"name":"fly","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[5,"level-up",18],[6,"level-up",18],[7,"level-up",18],[8,"level-up",13],[9,"level-up",13],[10,"level-up",13],[11,"level-up",13],[12,"level-up",18],[13,"level-up",18],[14,"level-up",10],[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",12],[23,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[5,"level-up",31],[6,"level-up",31],[7,"level-up",31],[8,"level-up",28],[9,"level-up",28],[10,"level-up",28],[11,"level-up",28],[12,"level-up",31],[13,"level-up",31],[14,"level-up",25],[15,"level-up",25],[16,"level-up",23],[17,"level-up",23],[18,"level-up",23],[20,"level-up",36],[23,"level-up",36],[25,"level-up",36],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],